TITLE: ADR-044 Unified Free-Canvas Dashboard
DATE: 2026-03-09
STATUS: Accepted

CONTEXT:
KosmosPage stored widgets in three fixed columns (left/middle/right).
Each column had different resize semantics (height px vs layout {x,y,w,h}).
Client requirement: every widget freely placeable anywhere on page — one unified canvas.

DECISION:
- KosmosPage.columns{left,middle,right} → KosmosPage.widgets[] (flat array)
- KosmosWidget.height removed; KosmosWidget.layout {x,y,w,h} always required
- New components: UnifiedCanvas (react-grid-layout, full-width), WidgetConfigPanel (320px right panel)
- ColumnStack and MiddleCanvas replaced by UnifiedCanvas (files retained but unused)
- 5 new widget types: confidenceBars, keyValueTable, frequencyChart, platformDiagram, agentChat
- Redux: removed reorderKosmosWidgets, updateKosmosWidgetHeight; added updateKosmosWidgetConfig
- Old dashboards with columns format migrated on load (concat left+middle+right, assign grid layouts)
- Share view updated to render widgets[] with read-only UnifiedCanvas
- New public route: GET /share/:token/devices/:deviceId/derived-state (validates token, returns device state)
- New hook: useSharedDeviceState for public viewers polling live data without JWT

CONSEQUENCES:
- Breaking: old dashboards lose precise widget placement (columns migrated to flat list)
- All 13 widget types first-class grid citizens; no column placement restrictions remain
- WidgetConfigPanel enables in-dashboard device/field binding without code changes
- Palette column badges removed; all widgets draggable to any canvas position
